## 2. "Trace before Design" Protocol & Execution Flows

<!-- MANDATORY: MUST TRACE BOTH PATHS BEFORE PROGRESSING TO INNOVATE (DECISION.MD) -->
<trace_before_design>

### 2.1 Happy Path Flow
```text
[Entry Point: API Endpoint / CLI Command / Event / UI Action]
  → [Auth & Payload Validation / Token Check]
  → [Domain & Business Logic Processing / Orchestration]
  → [State Mutation & Transaction Commit (DB / Cache / Queue)]
  → [Successful Output / HTTP 200 / Event Emitted / State Mutated]
```

### 2.2 Error & Rollback Path Flow
```text
[Failure Trigger: Invalid Input / Timeout / Constraint Violation / Downstream 5xx]
  → [Detection & Exception Handling Boundary / Filter]
  → [Rollback / Compensating Transaction / Resource Cleanup]
  → [Error Response / HTTP Status / Structured Diagnostic Logging]
```

### 2.3 Data-Flow Slices (ARISE Def-Use Chains)
<!-- Causal slices (10-50 lines) isolating exact variables instead of reading full files -->
- **Backward Slice (Defect Origin / Cause):** [Target Variable / Symptom] ← [Statement at file:line] ← [Input / State at file:line]
- **Forward Slice (Blast Radius / Impact):** [Mutation Point at file:line] → [Dependent Consumer at file:line] → [Data Sink / API Output at file:line]

</trace_before_design>

