| **Naming Conventions** | [File, class, function, variable, event casing & suffixes] | |
| **Layering & Boundaries** | [Layer hierarchy: Controller → Service → Repo, forbidden imports] | |
| **Exception Handling** | [Strategy: custom domain errors, Result/Either type, global filter] | |

### 3.2 Concurrency & Transactional Boundaries
| Area | Current Mechanism | Anchor / Evidence | Failure Risk (Race / Deadlock / Leak) |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Transaction Boundary** | [Where transaction begins / commits / rolls back] | | |
| **Concurrency / Locks** | [Mutex, optimistic/pessimistic lock, async await, queue isolation] | | |
| **Idempotency** | [Idempotency key, deduplication key, retry safety] | | |

### 3.3 Schema Invariants & Database Constraints
| Invariant / Constraint | Table / Field | Enforcement Level (DB vs App) | Failure Consequence |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Foreign Keys / Relations** | [Foreign keys, cascade rules, cardinality] | | |
| **Uniqueness** | [Unique index, composite unique keys] | | |
| **Check Constraints** | [Check constraint, not null, valid enums] | | |
| **Domain Invariants** | [Non-negative balance, one-way state progression] | | |

</constraints_and_invariants>

